## Business Rules

### Claims state machine
```
FILED → UNDER_REVIEW → APPROVED  → RESOLVED
                    └→ REJECTED  → RESOLVED
```
- Only the service changes status (never a direct PATCH on status field)
- Every transition saves ClaimStatusHistory
- Every transition emits Kafka event claim.status_changed

### AuditEvent is append-only — absolute rule
Never update or delete AuditEvent. Only INSERT. No UpdateAPIView, no DestroyAPIView. Regulatory requirement.

### Policy verification before claim
Claims service MUST call policy-service verify endpoint before creating any claim. Invalid/cancelled policy → 400, never creates the claim.

