## Testing Rules

### Unit tests — what to mock
- confluent_kafka.Producer → mock
- httpx inter-service calls → mock
- django.core.mail → mock

### Integration tests — what NOT to mock
- PostgreSQL → real DB with @pytest.mark.django_db
- Redis → real Redis for Channels/Celery tests

### Coverage targets: services.py 90%+, views.py 80%+, consumers.py 80%+

### Write tests in the same phase as the feature, never at the end.

