## NEVER Do This

| Forbidden | Reason |
|---|---|
| git commit/push without permission | User must explicitly approve |
| Direct commit to main or dev | Always work in feat branches |
| Mix unrelated changes in one commit | One commit = one logical change |
| Share DB between services | Violates Database per Service |
| Business logic in views.py | Must be in services.py |
| Use kafka-python | Use confluent-kafka (librdkafka) |
| Hardcode secrets or URLs | Use python-decouple + .env |
| Modify/delete AuditEvent | Regulatory requirement, append-only |
| New inter-service HTTP | Use Kafka instead |
| Send emails in Kafka consumer | Delegate to Celery task |
| Rate limiting in Django | Goes in Nginx gateway |
| Use pip install or requirements.txt | Use uv + pyproject.toml |
| Use flake8 or black | Use Ruff for everything |
| Use npm or yarn | Use pnpm in frontend |
| JOIN across service databases | Communicate via Kafka or HTTP |
